Rethlas multi-mode distribution
Based on Rethlas upstream commit 887cc46 (https://github.com/frenzymath/Rethlas).

This distribution preserves the upstream Apache License, Version 2.0.

Existing upstream files modified in 2026:
  .gitignore
  README.md
  agents/generation/.agents/skills/verify-proof/SKILL.md
  agents/generation/AGENTS.md
  agents/generation/.codex/config.toml
  agents/generation/.codex/agents/subgoal-prover.toml
  agents/generation/mcp/server.py
  agents/generation/tests/run_example.sh
  agents/verification/.codex/config.toml
  agents/verification/AGENTS.md
  agents/verification/api/server.py

The modifications add ChatGPT and sandboxed Codex workflows, GPT-6 Astra
defaults, fixed-statement and iterative-improvement verification, durable local
state, and dry-run, pause, resume, and terminal-status controls. Each modified
upstream file carries a prominent notice stating that it was changed.

New material includes chatgpt_workflow/, sandbox_workflow/, docs/,
RELEASE_NOTES.md, RELEASE_MANIFEST.md, and related tests. Adapted mathematical
skills record their upstream source paths and SHA-256 hashes in
chatgpt_workflow/skills/sources.json.

